sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor App as Application
    participant Tokenizer as Model tokenizer
    participant Decoder as Autoregressive decoder
    participant Choice as Decoding rule
    participant Text as Output text
    App->>Tokenizer: Trusted instructions + question + source-labeled data
    Tokenizer->>Decoder: Input token IDs x1 ... xn within context budget
    loop Until stop token, length cap, or policy stop
        Decoder->>Decoder: Causal attention over visible input and earlier output tokens
        Decoder->>Choice: Distribution p(y_t | x, y_before_t)
        Choice-->>Decoder: Chosen token y_t
        Decoder->>Decoder: Append y_t to visible prefix
    end
    Decoder-->>Text: Decode output token IDs to text
    Note over Decoder,Text: A fluent output is not a source-grounding judgment.
